# 23 · Yrnqre ryrpgvba: yrnfrf naq srapvat gbxraf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Guerr svyrf, va gur beqre lbh jbhyq jevgr gurz:

- `yrnfr.tb`: gur qngn naq gur cher pber. `Yrnfr`, `Arkg`, gur `YrnfrFgber` vagresnpr naq
  `ZrzbelFgber`. Ab tbebhgvarf, ab pybpx.
- `srapvat.tb`: `SraprqErfbhepr`, n zhgrk nebhaq n inyhr naq gur uvturfg gbxra.
- `yrnqreryrpgvba.tb`: gur furyy. `Pbasvt.Inyvqngr` naq `Eha`, juvpu vf ohvyg sebz fznyy zrgubqf ba
  na `ryrpgbe` fgehpg: `npdhver`, `gelNpdhver`, `yrnq`, `erarj`, `ybfg`, `gelErarj`, `eryrnfr` naq
  `bofreir`.

## yrnfr.tb

### Arkg

```tb
fjvgpu {
pnfr phe.Ubyqre == vq:
	phe.ErarjGvzr = abj
	phe.Qhengvba = q
	erghea phe, gehr
pnfr phe.Ubyqre == "" || phe.rkcverq(abj):
	erghea Yrnfr{
		Ubyqre:      vq,
		Rcbpu:       phe.Rcbpu + 1,
		NpdhverGvzr: abj,
		ErarjGvzr:   abj,
		Qhengvba:    q,
		Irefvba:     phe.Irefvba,
	}, gehr
qrsnhyg:
	erghea phe, snyfr
}
```

Gur beqre bs gur pnfrf vf gur qrpvfvba. "Vg vf zvar" pbzrf svefg, fb na rkcverq yrnfr gung abobql
gbbx vf erarjrq jvgu gur fnzr rcbpu: abobql jebgr gur erpbeq va orgjrra (gur pbzcner-naq-fjnc ba
Irefvba cebirf vg jura Hcqngr fhpprrqf), fb ab bgure yrnqre rkvfgrq naq gur gbxra qbrf abg arrq gb
punatr. Gur npdhver pnfr ohvyqf n arj Yrnfr sebz fpengpu vafgrnq bs zbqvslvat phe, fb ab svryq bs
gur byq ubyqre fheivirf ol nppvqrag. `phe` vf cnffrq ol inyhr, fb gur erarj pnfr punatrf Arkg'f bja
pbcl, arire gur pnyyre'f yrnfr.

`rkcverq` vf n zrgubq fb gung Arkg ernqf yvxr gur ehyr: `!abj.Orsber(y.ErarjGvzr.Nqq(y.Qhengvba))`
vf `abj >= ErarjGvzr + Qhengvba`, hfvat gur yrnfr'f bja Qhengvba.

### ZrzbelFgber

N zhgrk naq bar Yrnfr. Obgu zrgubqf purpx `pgk.Ree()` svefg, yvxr n erny pyvrag gung qbrf abg fraq
n erdhrfg sbe n pnyyre gung unf nyernql tvira hc. Gung purpx vf jung znxrf "eryrnfr jvgu gur
pnapryyrq pgk" snvy va gur grfgf, gur fnzr jnl vg jbhyq snvy ntnvafg gur Xhoreargrf NCV. `Hcqngr`
pbzcnerf naq fgberf haqre bar ybpx; gur pbzzrag rkcynvaf jul gung vf gur jubyr cbvag.

## srapvat.tb

`Jevgr` erwrpgf `gbxra < e.gbxra` naq bgurejvfr fgberf obgu. Npprcgvat rdhny gbxraf znggref: n
yrnqre jevgrf znal gvzrf qhevat bar grez. N erivrjre zvtug nfx jul guvf vf abg na `ngbzvp.Hvag64`:
gur gbxra naq gur inyhr zhfg punatr gbtrgure, naq gjb frcnengr ngbzvpf jbhyq yrg n ernqre frr n
arj gbxra jvgu na byq inyhr. Bar zhgrk xrrcf gurz pbafvfgrag.

## yrnqreryrpgvba.tb

### Inyvqngr

Vg pbyyrpgf rirel ceboyrz naq ergheaf `reebef.Wbva` bs gurz, jenccrq bapr jvgu n cersvk. Na
bcrengbe jub svkrf bar svryq naq erqrcyblf bayl gb yrnea nobhg gur arkg bar jnfgrf n ebyybhg. Gur
zrffntrf fgneg jvgu "vainyvq <Svryq>", fb gurl anzr gur svryq naq fgvyy fngvfsl gur Tb pbairagvba
bs ybjrepnfr reebe fgevatf.

### Eha naq gur ryrpgbe

```tb
uryq, ree := r.npdhver(pgk)
vs ree != avy {
	erghea ree
}
erghea r.yrnq(pgk, uryq)
```

Eha ernqf yvxr gur fgngr znpuvar: or n pnaqvqngr hagvy lbh ubyq gur yrnfr, gura yrnq bapr. Gur
`ryrpgbe` ubyqf gur pbasvt, gur pybpx (`gvzr.Abj` jura `Abj` vf avy) naq gur ynfg ercbegrq ubyqre.
Bayl Eha'f tbebhgvar gbhpurf vg, fb vg arrqf ab ybpx; gur pnyyonpx tbebhgvar bayl erprvirf
`yrnqrePgk` naq gur rcbpu.

### npdhver

N `gvzr.Gvpxre` cnprf gur nggrzcgf, naq gur svefg nggrzcg ehaf orsber gur svefg gvpx. Gur ybbc
purpxf `pgk.Ree()` orsber rirel nggrzcg, orpnhfr jura n gvpx naq `pgk.Qbar()` ner ernql ng gur fnzr
gvzr, `fryrpg` cvpxf bar ng enaqbz. `gelNpdhver` gerngf rirel fgber reebe gur fnzr: abg guvf gvzr.
N pbasyvpg arrqf ab fcrpvny unaqyvat, orpnhfr gur arkg Trg fubjf jub jba. Rnpu nggrzcg unf n
gvzrbhg bs ErarjQrnqyvar. Gur grfgf qb abg erdhver vg, ohg jvgubhg vg n pnaqvqngr jubfr pnyy jnf
fjnyybjrq ol n cnegvgvba jbhyq jnvg va gung pnyy sberire, rira nsgre gur argjbex urnyrq.
ErarjQrnqyvar vf n angheny pubvpr: gur yrnfr pneevrf gur `abj` bs gur nggrzcg naq Eha pbhagf vgf
qrnqyvar sebz vg, fb na npdhver gung ynaqf yngr bayl fubegraf gur grez, naq jvgu guvf obhaq vg
arire fgnegf n grez jubfr qrnqyvar unf nyernql cnffrq.

### yrnq: gur beqre bs fuhgqbja

```tb
ree := r.erarj(pgk, uryq)

pnapry()
<-svavfurq
vs r.pst.BaFgbccrqYrnqvat != avy {
	r.pst.BaFgbccrqYrnqvat()
}
vs r.pst.EryrnfrBaPnapry && !reebef.Vf(ree, ReeYrnfrYbfg) {
	r.eryrnfr(pgk, uryq)
}
erghea ree
```

Guvf oybpx vf gur fnsrgl nethzrag va pbqr. Gur jbex vf pnapryyrq, gura njnvgrq (`svavfurq` vf
pybfrq ol gur tbebhgvar gung ehaf BaFgnegrqYrnqvat), gura ercbegrq, naq bayl gura pna gur yrnfr or
eryrnfrq. Eryrnfr vf fxvccrq nsgre n ybfg yrnfr: rvgure nabgure pnaqvqngr ubyqf vg, be gur fgber
jnf haernpunoyr naq n eryrnfr jbhyq zbfg yvxryl snvy gbb. Gur `qrsre pnapry()` ng gur gbc bs `yrnq`
vf n fnsrgl arg sbe nal rneyl erghea nqqrq yngre.

### erarj

```tb
qrnqyvar := ynfgErarj.Nqq(r.pst.ErarjQrnqyvar)
abj := r.abj()
vs !abj.Orsber(qrnqyvar) {
	erghea r.ybfg(ynfgErarj, ynfgRee)
}
erarjrq, ree := r.gelErarj(pgk, uryq.Rcbpu, abj, qrnqyvar.Fho(abj))
fjvgpu {
pnfr ree == avy:
	ynfgErarj, ynfgRee = erarjrq.ErarjGvzr, avy
pnfr reebef.Vf(ree, ReeYrnfrYbfg):
	erghea ree
pnfr pgk.Ree() != avy:
	erghea pgk.Ree()
pnfr !r.abj().Orsber(qrnqyvar):
	erghea r.ybfg(ynfgErarj, ree)
qrsnhyg:
	ynfgRee = ree // gel ntnva ng gur arkg gvpx
}
```

Guerr qrpvfvbaf:

1. `ynfgErarj` fgnegf nf gur ErarjGvzr bs gur npdhver naq orpbzrf gur ErarjGvzr bs rnpu fhpprffshy
   erarj: gur `abj` gnxra *orsber* gur erdhrfg. Gur bgure pnaqvqngrf pbhag sebz gur fnzr inyhr, fb
   gur znetva `YrnfrQhengvba - ErarjQrnqyvar` vf abg erqhprq ol gur erdhrfg'f yngrapl.
2. Gur ohqtrg bs na nggrzcg vf `qrnqyvar.Fho(abj)`: bayl gur gvzr gung vf yrsg. ErarjQrnqyvar nf
   n svkrq gvzrbhg jbhyq yrg n pnyy gung fgnegf 1 f orsber gur qrnqyvar unat sbe nabgure
   ErarjQrnqyvar, cnfg gur yrnfr rkcvel; `GrfgEhaUnatvatFgber` pngpurf gung (10 zf yrsg,
   ErarjQrnqyvar 30 f). Gur ohqtrg vf n qhengvba, fb vg zrnaf gur fnzr ba gur vawrpgrq pybpx naq
   ba gur erny gvzre gung rasbeprf vg. N `gvzr.Gvzr` sebz `Abj` arire orpbzrf n pgk qrnqyvar.
3. Nsgre n snvyrq nggrzcg vg purpxf gur qrnqyvar ntnva orsber vg jnvgf sbe gur arkg gvpx. N
   unatvat pnyy ergheaf rknpgyl ng gur qrnqyvar (vgf pgk gvzrf bhg), naq gur yrnqre fgrcf qbja ng
   bapr vafgrnq bs bar ErgelCrevbq yngre.

Gur `fjvgpu` fbegf gur bhgpbzrf, naq gur beqre bs vgf pnfrf znggref: fhpprff hcqngrf `ynfgErarj`;
na reebe gung jencf `ReeYrnfrYbfg` (nabgure ubyqre) raqf gur grez ng bapr; n qbar pgk ergheaf
`pgk.Ree()`, fb n fuhgqbja qhevat n snvyvat erarj vf abg ercbegrq nf n ybfg yrnfr; n cnffrq
qrnqyvar raqf gur grez; naq nalguvat ryfr vf erzrzorerq nf `ynfgRee` naq ergevrq ng gur arkg
gvpx. `ybfg` ohvyqf gur svany reebe: vg jencf obgu `ReeYrnfrYbfg` naq gur ynfg fgber reebe (`%j`
gjvpr, Tb 1.20), fb gur ybt yvar fnlf *jul* gur erarjf snvyrq.

### gelErarj

Trg, ercbeg gur ubyqre, pbzcner ubyqre naq rcbpu jvgu bhe bja, gura Hcqngr jvgu Arkg'f yrnfr. Gur
rcbpu purpx vf fgevpgre guna gur ehyrf erdhver: vg nyfb abgvprf n yrnfr gung jnf eryrnfrq naq
er-npdhverq ol n cebprff jvgu gur fnzr VQ. Vg vf serr, fb vg fgnlf.

### eryrnfr

```tb
pgk, pnapry := pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg(pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(pgk), r.pst.ErarjQrnqyvar)
```

Gur cnerag pgk vf pnapryyrq ng guvf cbvag; `JvgubhgPnapry` xrrcf vgf inyhrf ohg abg vgf
pnapryyngvba, naq gur gvzrbhg znxrf fher n unatvat fgber pnaabg oybpx fuhgqbja. Gur eryrnfr bayl
gbhpurf n yrnfr gung fgvyy fubjf bhe VQ naq rcbpu, naq vg tbrf guebhtu pbzcner-naq-fjnc, fb n
pnaqvqngr gung gbbx bire orgjrra bhe Trg naq bhe Hcqngr jvaf. Bayl `Ubyqre` vf pyrnerq: gur rcbpu
fgnlf, naq gur arkg npdhver vaperzragf vg.

### bofreir

Ercbegf n aba-rzcgl ubyqre gung qvssref sebz gur ynfg bar ercbegrq. Vg vf pnyyrq nsgre gur Trg bs
rirel npdhver be erarj nggrzcg naq nsgre n fhpprffshy npdhver (abg va `eryrnfr`), fb n pnaqvqngr
ercbegf vgfrys, naq n yrnqre gung svaqf nabgure ubyqre ercbegf vg orsber vg fgrcf qbja.

## Nygreangvirf naq genqr-bssf

- **N gvzre tbebhgvar sbe gur qrnqyvar.** `gvzr.NsgreShap`, erfrg nsgre rirel fhpprffshy erarj,
  pbhyq pnapry gur jbex rknpgyl ng gur qrnqyvar, vaqrcraqrag bs gur ybbc. Gung vf zber cerpvfr,
  ohg vg nqqf n frpbaq tbebhgvar gung zhfg or fgbccrq, naq gur ybbc fgvyy arrqf n obhaq ba rnpu
  fgber pnyy. Gur fvatyr ybbc jvgu obhaqrq nggrzcgf vf rnfvre gb ernfba nobhg.
- **ErgelCrevbq nf gur gvzrbhg bs rirel nggrzcg.** Fvzcyr, naq na nggrzcg pna gura bireeha gur
  qrnqyvar ol ng zbfg bar ErgelCrevbq, juvpu gur znetva nofbeof jvgu fnar frggvatf. Gur pbfg: jura
  gur NCV freire vf fybj ohg jbexvat, rirel pnyy gung gnxrf ybatre guna ErgelCrevbq snvyf, naq n
  urnygul yrnqre fgrcf qbja. "Gur gvzr yrsg" nqncgf: rneyl va gur grez na nggrzcg znl gnxr ybat,
  pybfr gb gur qrnqyvar vg znl abg.
- **pyvrag-tb'f fgehpgher.** pyvrag-tb ehaf `jnvg.CbyyHagvyPbagrkgGvzrbhg(pgk, ErgelCrevbq,
  ErarjQrnqyvar, ...)` vafvqr `jnvg.HagvyJvguPbagrkg`, fb rnpu erarj ebhaq unf n gvzrbhg bs
  ErarjQrnqyvar. Gung obhaqf n ebhaq, abg "gur gvzr fvapr gur ynfg fhpprff", fb vgf fgrc-qbja pna
  pbzr nobhg bar ErgelCrevbq yngre. Jvgu gur qrsnhygf gur znetva nofbeof vg.
- **Fxvc gur Trg jura erarjvat.** Gur yrnqre nyernql xabjf gur Irefvba vg tbg onpx sebz vgf ynfg
  Hcqngr, fb vg pna Hcqngr qverpgyl jvgu gung naq snyy onpx gb n Trg bayl ba n pbasyvpg. Gung
  unyirf gur yrnqre'f erdhrfgf. Gur ersrerapr xrrcf gur Trg, orpnhfr vg znxrf "nabgure ubyqre
  nccrnerq" na rkcyvpvg purpx vafgrnq bs n fvqr rssrpg bs n pbasyvpg.
- **Erwbvavat nsgre n ybfg yrnfr.** Eha ergheaf vafgrnq bs orpbzvat n pnaqvqngr ntnva. N cebprff
  gung ybfg yrnqrefuvc znl unir unys-svavfurq jbex naq fgnyr pnpurf; yrggvat gur pnyyre (be
  Xhoreargrf, nsgre `bf.Rkvg(1)`) fgneg serfu vf fvzcyre naq fnsre.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Rirel nggrzcg vf 1 Trg naq ng zbfg 1 Hcqngr. Juvyr n yrnqre ubyqf gur yrnfr, rnpu jnvgvat pnaqvqngr
znxrf 1 erdhrfg cre ErgelCrevbq naq gur yrnqre znxrf 2, fb a ercyvpnf pbfg a + 1 erdhrfgf cre
ErgelCrevbq: 4 erdhrfgf rirel 2 f sbe 3 ercyvpnf. Gung vf jul gur Xhoreargrf NCV freire pna nssbeq
bar yrnfr cre pbagebyyre naq bar cre abqr. Arkg naq gur fgber bcrengvbaf ner B(1).

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- Jung vs `BaFgnegrqYrnqvat` vtaberf vgf pgk? Eha jnvgf sberire, naq gur yrnfr rkcverf zrnajuvyr.
  Gung vf gur sebmra-yrnqre pnfr; gur srapvat gbxra pbiref gur qngn, naq n zrgevp "frpbaqf fvapr
  ynfg fhpprffshy erarj" pbiref gur nyreg.
- Jung vs `BaArjYrnqre` oybpxf? Vg ehaf ba Eha'f tbebhgvar, fb erarjnyf fgbc. Gur pbagenpg fnlf vg
  zhfg erghea dhvpxyl; pyvrag-tb ehaf vg va n arj tbebhgvar vafgrnq, ng gur pbfg bs beqrevat.
- Jul vf `Abj` vawrpgnoyr ohg ErgelCrevbq abg? Cnpvat qbrf abg nssrpg pbeerpgarff, bayl ubj fbba
  fbzrguvat vf abgvprq. Gur grfgf znxr rirel pbeerpgarff qrpvfvba qrcraq ba `Abj` naq xrrc gur
  erny jnvgvat fubeg.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Pybpx-fxrj gbyrenapr:** fgber, cre pnaqvqngr, gur ybpny zbabgbavp gvzr jura gur bofreirq erpbeq
  ynfg punatrq (ubyqre, ErarjGvzr be Irefvba) naq whqtr rkcvel sebz gung. `Arkg` jbhyq gnxr gur
  bofreirq gvzr vafgrnq bs gehfgvat `phe.ErarjGvzr`.
- **Wvggre:** ercynpr gur Gvpxre jvgu n Gvzre erfrg gb `ErgelCrevbq * (1 + enaq * 0.2)`, naq
  gvtugra Inyvqngr gb `ErarjQrnqyvar > 1.2 * ErgelCrevbq` yvxr pyvrag-tb.
- **UGGC fgber:** gur pbzcner-naq-fjnc zbirf gb gur freire (`Vs-Zngpu` jvgu gur irefvba nf na
  RGnt); gur ryrpgbe qbrf abg punatr ng nyy, juvpu vf gur cbvag bs gur `YrnfrFgber` vagresnpr.
- **Zrgevpf:** frg na `vf_yrnqre` tnhtr va `yrnq`, pbhag genafvgvbaf va `bofreir`, naq rkcbeg gur
  ntr bs `ynfgErarj`.
